00:15:10.327 --> 00:15:11.244
That way...

00:15:12.871 --> 00:15:16.655
Yeah (laughs), I'll leave now.

00:15:16.655 --> 00:15:18.532
- Yeah, I'll see you later Dustin.

00:15:18.532 --> 00:15:19.723
Alright, Mr. Top Floor, what's good?

00:15:19.723 --> 00:15:20.927
Chloe!

00:15:20.927 --> 00:15:21.760
- Hi.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:22.798
- Hi, how are you?

00:15:22.798 --> 00:15:24.475
- Good, thanks, how are you?

00:15:24.475 --> 00:15:26.103
- Awesome.

00:15:26.103 --> 00:15:28.978
- Well, my question, it's
kind of like balancing.

00:15:28.978 --> 00:15:31.651
I want to know your
perspective on balancing

00:15:31.651 --> 00:15:35.034
running a business and my passion,

00:15:35.034 --> 00:15:36.794
which is writing.

00:15:36.794 --> 00:15:39.026
I wrote a book, I kind
of shopped it around,

00:15:39.026 --> 00:15:42.768
I had some interest,
ultimately got rejected.

00:15:42.768 --> 00:15:44.042
But they gave me really great advice

00:15:44.042 --> 00:15:45.545
on my rejection letter.

00:15:45.545 --> 00:15:48.776
But instead of (audio cuts) down there,

00:15:48.776 --> 00:15:49.609
which I think would have been

00:15:49.609 --> 00:15:51.280
the natural kind of response,

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:53.815
instead I went all in on my business.

00:15:53.815 --> 00:15:57.843
And I now run a digital
kind of marketing agency

00:15:57.843 --> 00:16:00.582
where I help out writers actually,

00:16:00.582 --> 00:16:03.019
which I'm very passionate
about, it fulfills me.

00:16:03.019 --> 00:16:04.879
I have one full-time person working for me

00:16:04.879 --> 00:16:06.450
and five other part-time.

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:09.047
And I don't know, I just, I don't know,

00:16:09.047 --> 00:16:10.837
