00:20:22.188 --> 00:20:23.508
I'm not even kidding.

00:20:23.508 --> 00:20:26.770
I think that I so didn't
conform to the school system,

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:29.953
and I so didn't pay attention,
starting in third grade,

00:20:29.953 --> 00:20:32.214
that I was just in my own fucking world.

00:20:32.214 --> 00:20:34.956
And I think in some weird ways,

00:20:34.956 --> 00:20:39.239
that simplicity has been
a huge guiding light.

00:20:39.239 --> 00:20:41.239
I keep it basic as fuck.

00:20:42.613 --> 00:20:45.585
